      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akīīta ūnoolekeja mongo gwa minzī mapanga mateemagīzu gītī ilole; gwalī gūfumīīlile a hī Isumbi lya būtemi lya ng'wa Mulungu na Ng'wana wa Ng'holo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwahūūmaga kūbītīla a ha gatī gatī y'ibbala bbala lyamo. Ū kū ngegu ja mongo gwenūyo, ī lipandī īlī nī lipandī īlī, gwalīho ntī gwa būpanga, gwatwajaga mbika ikūmi n'ibīlī ja matwajo; mu katwagīje ka būlī ng'weji. A madūūtū gaho ga kūlagūlīla mahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo lītūbiza mo izumo na hado yaya ū mu nzengo gwenūyo; ī Lisumbī lya būtemi lya ng'wa Mulungu na Ng'wana wa Ng'holo līkūbiza ng'wenūmo, hama a batūmami bakwe bakūbiza balamya bakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūbūbona ū būshū bokwe, nī lina lyakwe līkūbiza lyandīkilwe ū kū būshū wabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būtūbiza ho būjikū na hado yaya, na ītīho nguno ya kūbiza na būpe bo tala nūūlū bo līīmi, nguno ū Seeba Mulungu ng'wenekīlī h'ūyo akūbiza Isana lyabo, bakūsuga shikū ja shiku jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ūniwīla gīkī, “Ū mihayo yenīyī īlī ya ng'hana, nīyo shiigelile īsanyiwe. Hūna lūūlū, ū Seeba Mulungu wa myoyo ya bahangi, wantūmaga malaika wakwe kwiza kūboolekeja a batūmami bakwe, ī mihayo īyo shiigelile ībize ho wangū.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kwiza kwa ng'wa Kilisito",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Managa gīkī naliza wangū, alī na lubango ū wa kīdima ī mihayo ya būhangi ūbo wandīkilwe ū mu shitabo shenīshi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene Yohana hū nalī ng'wene ūyo nakīyigwa na kwībona ī mihayo yenīyī. Ī mihayo yenīyī aho nīyigwa nū kwībona nībona, nakagwa kū magūlū gakwe ū malaika ūyo wanoolekejaga, nūgwa gīkī naanamye! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū wei ūniwīla, “Lekaga ū kwīta ī gīko, ū nene nane nalī ntūmami ng'wiyo dūhū, hamò na a badūgū bako a bahangi, na a babo bīdimile ī mihayo ya mu shitabo shenīshi, namyage Mulungu!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūniwīla gīkī, “Yaya ū kwībisa ī mihayo ya mu shitabo shenīshi, nguno ī likanza lyegeelaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo atī ntūngīlīja ni ongejage kwīta īyo ītī ya būtūngīlīja, ū nsoso nang'hwe ongeje kwisosohaja; nū ntūngīlīja ni ongejage kwīta ī ya būtūngīlīja, ū ng'wela nang'hwe ongeje ū kwiyeeja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Managa gīkī naliza wangū, nalī nayo nī mheela yane. Būlī munhū nakūng'winha mheela ya kūlenganīla na shītwa shakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nalī Alufa na Omega, nalī wa Kwandya na wa Kūmalīja, Wandījo na Būkalīkījo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balī na lubango abo bafulile shizwalo shabo, gīkī banukūle būdūla bo kūbiza na ngabo ū kū ntī gwa būpanga, hama badūle kūbīta a ha mibita, bingīle ū mu nzengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a hanze jilīho mva, na balogi, na bajingi, na babūlagi, na balamya ba shiikolile; na a balomolomo, abo batogilwe kwīta ya būlomolomo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nene Yesu nantūmaga malaika wane kwika kū kanisa jose, ize kūmukaanīla. Hū nene ūyo nalī Nji go ng'wa Daūdi na wa lūganda lokwe; nalī Sonda ng'weku ya mu makīngo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Moyo nū Ntoolwa balīhaya, “Nzūgū!” Hama ūyo aliigwa ni ahayage gīkī, “Nzūgū,” nū yūyo akolilwe nota ni izage. Ūyo alītogwa ni anukūlage dalali minzī mapanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene nalīng'hūgūla būlī munhū ū wa kwīyigwa ī mihayo ya būhangi wa mu shitabo shenīshi gīkī, ose ose ūyo ongeja mhayo a higūlya ya yenīyī, ū Mulungu akūng'ongeja ū būluhiwa ūbo wandīkilwe ū mu shitabo shenīshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nūūlū ose ose wīnja mhayo ū mu yose īyo yandīkilwe ū mu shitabo sha būhangi wenūbū, ū Mulungu akūng'wīngīja ū ngabo gwakwe a ha ntī gwa būpanga, nū mu nzengo ng'wela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Nkaanīji wayo ī mihayo yenīyī alīhaya, “Ee naliza wangū.” Alichene, nzūgū Seeba Yesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shigongo sha ng'wa Seeba Yesu shibize hamò na banhū bose a ba ng'wa Mulungu. Alichene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.22.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "previous": {
    "id": "REV.21",
